      "chapter": "pk-punjab/xi/physics/c11-phy/ch2",
      "topic": "pk-punjab/xi/physics/c11-phy/ch2/u-height-of-the-projectile",
      "title": "Height of the Projectile (Roman Urdu)",
      "language": "roman_ur",
      "variant_of": "C11-PHY-CH2-2.6-HEIGHT-OF-THE-PROJECTILE",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "source_document_id": "e2c5c034-041b-5340-9823-5e3c8c88a07c",
          "pdf_from": 34,
          "pdf_to": 34,
          "note": "Height of the Projectile: a main subheading of 2.6 Projectile motion, its own page (owner 2026-11-04); PDF 34-34."
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Maximum height nikalne ke liye yeh equation of motion lagate hain:"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "2aS = v_f^2 - v_i^2",
            "text_alt": "2aS = vf² - vi²"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Oopar jate hue a = -g hai. Is equation mein initial velocity ki jagah vertical component viy = vi sin θ aata hai, aur final velocity ki jagah vfy = 0, kyun ke sab se oonche point par body ki vertical velocity zero ho jati hai. Aur:"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "S = \\text{height} = h",
            "text_alt": "S = height = h"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "-2gh = 0 - v_i^2\\sin^2\\theta",
            "text_alt": "-2gh = 0 - vi² sin²θ"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "\\text{or}\\quad h = \\frac{v_i^2\\sin^2\\theta}{2g} \\tag{2.22}",
            "text_alt": "or h = vi² sin²θ / 2g   (2.22)"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Air resistance (hawa ki rukawat) ho to projectile ki height kam ho jati hai, kyun ke yeh resistance oopar wali velocity ko jaldi ghata deti hai."
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
